      "body": "## Bevy version\r\n\r\nbevy 0.11.3\r\nbevy_render 0.11.3\r\n\r\n## What you did\r\n\r\ncopied example code for compute_shader_game_of_life.rs into new project along with shader code in assets/shaders folder\r\n\r\n## What went wrong\r\n\r\nBuild fails with:\r\nerror[E0599]: no variant or associated item named `PrepareBindGroups` found for enum `RenderSet` in the current scope\r\n\r\n src\\main.rs:79:50\r\n\r\nprepare_bind_group.in_set(RenderSet::PrepareBindGroups)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nUsing \"Go to definition\" in VSCode shows the enum that is, I believe, the version of lib.rs from 2 months ago (July 4th commit):\r\n\r\n[https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/608367f9059c4391cade8dfbc811a8e02255ae25/crates/bevy_render/src/lib.rs](url)\r\n\r\nNot the more recent ones with PrepareBindGroups added around the end of August.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
